<title>AUSTRIA: Boehler details nine-month results.</title>
<headline>Boehler details nine-month results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending September 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating			   1,112   vs   1,070</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				 890   vs     966</p>
<p>    Group net				     632   vs     811</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			   1,241   vs   1,472</p>
<p>    Group sales				13,285   vs  13,848</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   7,133   vs   9,533</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   9,537   vs  10,302</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Boehler-Uddeholm AG. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 274</p>
